{
    "title": "Mow My Lawn - Cutting Grass",
    "description": "Fight with grass in the Mow My Lawn game. You need to control the guy with the lawn mover and rid the yard of the grass as fast as you can in this mowing game! Move around the area, cut the thickets and collect fruits and vegetables hidden in the thick of grass.\r\n\r\nDo you think it\u2019s pretty easy? Huh, no such luck! Grass grows at the speed of light! You need to mow your lawn and help you neighbors to crop the bushes. Get the turbo lawn mower to cut the grass faster and save the yard!\r\n\r\nThere are several locations to harvest crops, move from level to level to explore more territories and add different plants to your collection.\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n- Easy controls\r\n- Amazing graphics\r\n- Addictive gameplay\r\n- Beautiful locations\r\n- Intuitive interface\r\n\r\nBecome the fastest gardener in the village with the Mow My Lawn game. Harvest as much crops as you can to win!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fight with grass in the Mow My Lawn game. You need to control the guy with the lawn mover and rid the yard of the grass as fast as you can in this mowing game! Move around the area, cut the thickets and collect fruits and vegetables hidden in the thick of grass.<br><br>Do you think it\u2019s pretty easy? Huh, no such luck! Grass grows at the speed of light! You need to mow your lawn and help you neighbors to crop the bushes. Get the turbo lawn mower to cut the grass faster and save the yard!<br><br>There are several locations to harvest crops, move from level to level to explore more territories and add different plants to your collection.<br><br>GAME FEATURES:<br>- Easy controls<br>- Amazing graphics<br>- Addictive gameplay<br>- Beautiful locations<br>- Intuitive interface<br><br>Become the fastest gardener in the village with the Mow My Lawn game. Harvest as much crops as you can to win!",
    "summary": "Cut the grass with a lawn mower & collect harvest in mowing games!",
